---
// FAQSection.astro - Frequently Asked Questions
---

<section id="faq" class="section faq-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="section-description">Quick answers to common questions about our services and licensing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
      <div class="faq-item glass">
        <div class="faq-content">
          <h3 class="faq-question">Instrumentals – Quality? Edits? Exclusive?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">Each beat has a full mix with headroom for best recording experience<br>
          Mp3 – 320Kbps mp3s - Comes as is, no edits by me<br>
          Wav – 24 bit 48 kHz – I will do one structure edit upon request<br>
          Exclusive – Previous clients can still use their copy, no future sales</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
      <div class="faq-item glass">
        <div class="faq-content">
          <h3 class="faq-question">Producing Custom Content</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">This includes but is not limited to producing music/ soundscapes for:<br>
              Podcasts, Spoken Word, Commercials, Shows, Movies, Games<br>
          I will send an upload link if you have original content to send<br>
          All projects are reviewed in order to ensure it's a good fit</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
      <div class="faq-item glass">
        <div class="faq-content">
          <h3 class="faq-question">Mixing & Mastering – What's the process?</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">First we'll have a conversation about your plans with the project<br>
          Heavy need for pitch correction charged at standard /hr rate<br>
          As work proreceive links to drafts, mix & master folders<br>
          Check ins to ensure we're on the right track, till it's complete</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
      <div class="faq-item glass">
        <div class="faq-content">
          <h3 class="faq-question">Pricing</h3>
          <p class="faq-answer">Hourly vs per track pricing depends on the project, upon review<br>
          Payment accepted via Stripe, Venmo, Zelle and PayPal<br>
          Your order may be subject to tax, depending on where you live<br>
          Once we've finished a project, reviews are greatly appreciated</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-section {
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .section-description {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .faq-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-8);
    }
  }

  .faq-item {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
    cursor: default;
  }

  .faq-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .faq-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .faq-question {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .faq-answer {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Mobile optimization */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .faq-item {
      padding: var(--space-5);
    }

    .faq-question {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }

    .faq-answer {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }
  }
</style>
